ableUniverses/QDifferentialGeometry.lean#L83-L83","doc":"**Defining formula**: `ℒ_q = 𝒟_∇² + ψ* ⊗ 𝒟_∇ψ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalLagrangian.lagrangian","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalLagrangian.lagrangian","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QDifferentialGeometry.lean#L81-L81","doc":"The Lagrangian endomorphism `ℒ_q ∈ End(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalLagrangian.costate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalLagrangian.costate","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QDifferentialGeometry.lean#L79-L79","doc":"The costate `ψ* : A → 𝟙`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalLagrangian.state","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalLagrangian.state","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QDifferentialGeometry.lean#L77-L77","doc":"The state `ψ : 𝟙 → A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalLagrangian.dirac","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalLagrangian.dirac","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QDifferentialGeometry.lean#L75-L75","doc":"The Dirac operator `𝒟_∇`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalLagrangian.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalLagrangian.mk","kind":"ctor","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUnive