":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.nablaEndo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.nablaEndo","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QDifferentialGeometry.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The endomorphism representative of the connection `∇ : A → A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.q_unit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.q_unit","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QDifferentialGeometry.lean#L55-L55","doc":"`q` is a unit: `q · q⁻¹ = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.qinv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.qinv","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QDifferentialGeometry.lean#L53-L53","doc":"The inverse `q⁻¹ ∈ R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.q","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QDifferentialGeometry.lean#L51-L51","doc":"The substrate parameter `q ∈ R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.connection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.connection","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/QDifferentialGeometry.lean#L49-L49","doc":"The underlying conn